<Paragraph Type="Scene Heading"><Text>INT. STATION - DAY</Text></Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>A train arrives.</Text></Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>MARA</Text></Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text RevisionID="1">We should go.</Text></Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Scene Heading"><Text>EXT. STREET - NIGHT</Text></Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>The street is quiet.</Text></Paragraph>
